<title>USA: EarthLink stake held by Storie group.</title>
<headline>EarthLink stake held by Storie group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Storie Partners LP said Wednesday it holds a 5.14 percent stake in EarthLink Network Inc or 545,999 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 16,000 common shares between March 27 and May 9 at prices ranging from $11.75 to $13.375 per share.</p>
<p>EarthLink, based in Pasadena, Calif., is an Internet service provider.</p>
